#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:44
#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:51
msgid "Fullcone NAT"
msgstr "全锥型 NAT"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic.json:3
msgid "Grant access to fullcone firewall settings"
msgstr "授予访问全锥型防火墙设置的权限"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:53
msgid ""
"Uses all supported protocols. Enabling Fullcone NAT automatically enables "
"IPv4 and IPv6 masquerading. Disabling either masquerading option also "
"disables Fullcone NAT for this zone. Disabling Fullcone NAT leaves "
"masquerading unchanged. Usually enable this only on the WAN zone."
msgstr ""
"使用所有受支持的协议。启用全锥型NAT时自动开启 IPv4 和 IPv6 地址伪装。关闭任一"
"地址伪装选项时，也会关闭对应区域的全锥型NAT。关闭全锥型NAT不会更改地址伪装设"
"置。通常仅需在 WAN 区域开启。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:54
msgid ""
"Uses all supported protocols. Enabling Fullcone NAT automatically enables "
"IPv4 masquerading. Disabling masquerading also disables Fullcone NAT for "
"this zone. Disabling Fullcone NAT leaves masquerading unchanged. Usually "
"enable this only on the WAN zone."
msgstr ""
"使用所有受支持的协议。启用全锥型NAT时自动开启 IPv4 地址伪装。关闭地址伪装时，"
"也会关闭对应区域的全锥型NAT。关闭全锥型NAT不会更改地址伪装设置。通常仅需在 "
"WAN 区域开启。"
